        <h1 style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);">Compact, Not Compromised: A Walnut Pronorm ADU in Santa Barbara</h1>
        <p class="subtitle" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">An accessory dwelling that lives like a primary home — Skinny Shaker in Natural Walnut, full-height calacatta, panel-ready appliances, and a freestanding table-island that turns the kitchen into a dining room.</p>
        <div class="article-meta">
          <span>By Pronorm USA</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <time datetime="2026-05-04">May 4, 2026</time>
