        <img src="/images/magazine/santa-barbara-adu-skinny-shaker-walnut/01-kitchen-wide.webp" alt="Compact ADU kitchen in Santa Barbara — Skinny Shaker walnut base cabinets, white uppers, panel-ready Sub-Zero column, calacatta backsplash, freestanding wood-and-stone table-island" loading="eager" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:21/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px;" />
